ng twist is the payoff.", "topicality": {"tier": "month", "event_date": "2026-09-01", "rationale": "Pegged to a TV series airing on Nova in autumn 2026; fresh while the show is running."}, "factcheck_tier": "web", "verified": true, "verification_score": 0.9, "verification_notes": "Jana Nagyová is famous as Princess Arabela (1979–80 series) and is in the Studna cast per Deník; Nova's autumn 2026 airing after the Voyo premiere is consistent with MediaGuru."}, "created_at": null}, "cost_cents": null, "media_url": null, "image_subtype": null, "media_duration_seconds": null, "explanation": "Slovenka Nagyová v Arabele nemluvila vlastním hlasem. Česky ji namluvila Libuše Šafránková.", "embedding_model": "text-embedding-3-small", "embedding_dim": 1536, "subtopic": null, "answer_key": null, "embedding_qa_model": "text-embedding-3-small", "expires_at": null, "freshness_tag": null, "boost_until": null}, {"id": "80816463-2e09-43f7-9763-1e6702aadbc6", "question": "Ve třetí řadě reality show Zrádci, která na Primě odstartovala v září 2026, se na zámku znovu hledají zrádci mezi věrnými. Z které země tento formát, dnes vysílaný po celém světě, původně pochází?", "type": "text", "possible_answers": null, "correct_answer": "Nizozemsko", "alternative_answers": ["Holandsko"], "headline_answer": null, "topic": "Reality show", "category": "entertainment", "difficulty": "hard", "tags": [], "language_dependent": false, "age_appropriate": "all", "language": "cs", "pack_id": null, "prompt_seed": "85f27c1ebe11fb90", "created_at": "2026-10-14T13:39:53.791599", "created_by": null, "source": "generated", "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Traitors_(franchise)", "source_excerpt": "The franchise originated in the Netherlands with De Verraders, which premiered in 2021 on RTL4.", "usage_count": 0, "user_ratings": {}, "review_status": "approved", "reviewed_by": "machine:gates-v1", "reviewed_at": "2026-10-14T11:43:16.036869Z", "review_notes": null, "quality_ratings": null, "generation_me