outezici-40571336)."}, "created_at": null}, "cost_cents": null, "media_url": null, "image_subtype": null, "media_duration_seconds": null, "explanation": "Na parket ji vede Michal Kurtiš, který StarDance už jednou vyhrál s Annou Polívkovou.", "embedding_model": "text-embedding-3-small", "embedding_dim": 1536, "subtopic": null, "answer_key": null, "embedding_qa_model": "text-embedding-3-small", "expires_at": null, "freshness_tag": null, "boost_until": "2026-11-30T00:00:00Z"}, {"id": "58cbb792-0de4-4c85-9026-87892fa91037", "question": "Kultovní Pelíšky začínají Vánocemi a končí létem, které změní životy obou rodin. Ve kterém roce jejich děj končí?", "type": "text_multichoice", "possible_answers": {"a": "1948", "b": "1968", "c": "1989"}, "correct_answer": "1968", "alternative_answers": [], "headline_answer": null, "topic": "Česká filmová klasika", "category": "entertainment", "difficulty": "easy", "tags": [], "language_dependent": false, "age_appropriate": "all", "language": "cs", "pack_id": null, "prompt_seed": "85f27c1ebe11fb90", "created_at": "2026-10-14T13:39:53.791689", "created_by": null, "source": "generated", "source_url": "https://www.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cosy_Dens", "source_excerpt": "covers the months from Christmas 1967 up to the 1968 Prague Spring... The Soviet invasion of August 1968 shatters their everyday lives by the end.", "usage_count": 0, "user_ratings": {}, "review_status": "approved", "reviewed_by": "machine:gates-v1", "reviewed_at": "2026-10-14T11:43:16.036869Z", "review_notes": null, "quality_ratings": null, "generation_metadata": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "provider": "anthropic", "prompt_version": "direct_v1", "pipeline": null, "generation_flow": "fun-redesign-72", "generation_temperature": null, "critique_model": null, "critique_score": null, "reasoning_pattern": "year_guess", "fact_ids": [], "extra": {"stage": "initial_generation", "escape_hatch": true, "gen_craft_guards": true, "why_interesting": "Everyone remembers the Christmas scenes and the quotes, but the year the story ends in reframes the whole comedy as a historical tragedy.", "topicality": {"tier": "none", "event_date": null, "rationale": "Classic film trivia, not news."}, "factcheck_tier": "web", "verified": true, "verification_score": 0.9, "verification_notes": "Pelíšky spans Christmas 1967 to summer 1968, ending with the August 1968 Soviet invasion, so 1968 is correct (https://www.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cosy_Dens)."}, "created_at": null}, "cost_cents": null, "media_url": null, "image_subtype": null, "media_duration_seconds": null, "explanation": "Film začíná o Vánocích 1967 a končí v srpnu 1968 příjezdem okupačních vojsk. Proto se Kraus v závěru vrací ke svému hořkému „bolševik“.", "embedding_model": "text-embedding-3-small", "embedding_dim": 1536, "subtopic": null, "answer_key": null, "embedding_qa_model": "text-embedding-3-small", "expires_at": null, "freshness_tag": null, "boost_until": null}, {"id": "bd5e0d88-f829-4450-b36b-603ae1cc195d", "question": "Zasněžený zámek, kam Popelka ve Třech oříšcích pro Popelku přijíždí na ples, ve skutečnosti nestojí v Česku. Ve které zemi ho najdeme?", "type": "text", "possible_answers": null, "correct_answer": "Německo", "alternative_answers": ["V Německu", "Sasko", "NDR"], "headline_answer": null, "topic": "Česká filmová klasika", "category": "entertainment", "difficulty": "medium", "tags": [], "language_dependent": false, "age_appropriate": "all", "language": "cs", "pack_id": null, "prompt_seed": "85f27c1ebe11fb90", "created_at": "2026-10-14T13:39:53.791709", "created_by": null, "source": "generated", "source_url": "https://www.novinky.cz/clanek/vase-zpravy-moritzburg-proslavila-pohadka-o-popelce-naleznete-zde-take-perovou-komnatu-nebo-jediny-sasky-majak-309601", "source_excerpt": "Moritzburg proslavila pohádka o Popelce (paraphrased from search summary: all castle exteriors for the film were shot at Moritzburg in Saxony)", "usage_count": 0, "user_ratings": {}, "review_status": "approved", "reviewed_by": "machine:gates-v1", "reviewed_at": "2026-10-14T11:43:16.036869Z", "review_notes": null, "quality_ratings": null, "generation_metadata": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "provider": "anthropic", "prompt_version": "direct_v1", "pipeline": null, "generation_flow": "fun-redesign-72", "generation_temperature": null, "critique_model": null, "critique_score": null, "reasoning_pattern": "hidden_location", "fact_ids": [], "extra": {"stage": "initial_generation", "escape_hatch": true, "gen_craft_guards": true, "why_interesting": "The most Czech Christmas film of all has its iconic snowy castle abroad. Players who half-remember the German co-production can get there.", "topicality": {"tier": "none", "event_date": null, "rationale": "Classic film filming-location trivia."}, "factcheck_tier": "web", "verified": true, "verification_score": 0.9, "verification_notes": "The castle exteriors in Tři oříšky pro Popelku, including the snowy castle, were filmed at Moritzburg in Saxony, Germany (https://www.novinky.cz/clanek/vase-zpravy-moritzburg-proslavila-pohadka-o-popelce-naleznete-zde-take-perovou-komnatu-nebo-jediny-sasky-majak-309601)."}, "created_at": null}, "cost_cents": null, "media_url": null, "image_subtype": null, "media_duration_seconds": null, "explanation": "Je to zámek Moritzburg u Drážďan. Každou zimu se tam koná výstava věnovaná právě Popelce.", "embedding_model": "text-embedding-3-small", "embedding_dim": 1536, "subtopic": null, "answer_key": null, "embedding_qa_model": "text-embedding-3-small", "expires_at": null, "freshness_tag": null, "boost_until": null}, {"id": "5ac96e6d-8cd3-4ac2-ac72-339b7471e70c", "question": "Písnička Jožin z bažin od Ivana Mládka vznikla v 70. letech, ale v roce 2008 se nečekaně stala virálním hitem v jedné sousední zemi, kde ji pak zpívaly davy na koncertech. Ve které?", "type": "text", "possible_answers": null, "correct_answer": "Polsko", "alternative_answers": ["V Polsku"], "headline_answer": null, "topic": "Česká hudba", "category": "entertainment", "difficulty": "medium", "tags": [], "language_dependent": false, "age_appropriate": "all", "language": "cs", "pack_id": null, "prompt_seed": "85f27c1ebe11fb90", "created_at": "2026-10-14T13:39:53.791724", "created_by": null, "source": "generated", "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jo%C5%BEin_z_ba%C5%BEin", "source_excerpt": "In January 2008, the clip of the song unexpectedly became popular in Poland, winning several radio hit lists", "usage_count": 0, "user_ratings": {}, "review_status": "approved", "reviewed_by": "machine:gates-v1", "reviewed_at": "2026-10-14T11:43:16.036869Z", "review_notes": null, "quality_ratings": null, "generation_metadata": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "provider": "anthropic", "prompt_version": "direct_v1", "pipeline": null, "generation_flow": "fun-redesign-72", "generation_temperature": null, "critique_model": null, "critique_score": null, "reasoning_pattern": "unexpected_second_life", "fact_ids": [], "extra": {"stage": "initial_generation", "escape_hatch": true, "gen_craft_guards": true, "why_interesting": "A silly Czech country tune about a swamp monster conquering a neighbouring country decades later is delightful. Narrowing to neighbours makes it winnable.", "topicality": {"tier": "none", "event_date": null, "rationale": "Historical 2008 viral moment; general culture."}, "factcheck_tier": "web", "verified": true, "verification_score": 0.9, "verification_notes": "Wikipedia confirms the 1977 song unexpectedly became a hit in Poland in 2008; no newer event invalidates this (https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Jo%C5%BEin_z_ba%C5%BEin)."}, "created_at": null}, "cost_cents": null, "media_url": null, "image_subtype": null, "media_duration_seconds": null, "explanation": "Video se bleskově šířilo polským internetem a Mládek pak v Polsku vyprodával koncerty. Jožin tam dodnes patří k nejznámějším českým písničkám.", "embedding_model": "text-embedding-3-small", "embedding_dim": 1536, "subtopic": null, "answer_key": null, "embedding_qa_model": "text-embedding-3-small", "expires_at": null, "freshness_tag": null, "boost_until": null}, {"id": "67383641-7239-4d1b-a9b1-7f84ab66935b", "question": "Plyšový Krteček se v roce 2011 vydal na šestnáctidenní výlet, na jaký se dostane jen málokterá hračka, a to stovky kilometrů nad Zemi. Kam se podíval?", "type": "text", "possible_answers": null, "correct_answer": "Do vesmíru", "alternative_answers": ["Na ISS", "Na Mezinárodní vesmírnou stanici", "Na oběžnou dráhu", "Do kosmu"], "headline_answer": null, "topic": "Večerníčky", "category": "entertainment", "difficulty": "easy", "tags": [], "language_dependent": false, "age_appropriate": "all", "language": "cs", "pack_id": null, "prompt_seed": "85f27c1ebe11fb90", "created_at": "2026-10-14T13:39:53.791738", "created_by": null, "source": "generated", "source_url": "https://iol.co.za/news/2011-03-23-space-the-final-frontier-for-little-mole/", "source_excerpt": "Feustel picked the character as a lucky charm, and the mission was meant to get young people interested in space and science.", "usage_count": 0, "user_ratings": {}, "review_status": "approved", "reviewed_by": "machine:gates-v1", "reviewed_at": "2026-10-14T11:43:16.036869Z", "review_notes": null, "quality_ratings": null, "generation_metadata": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "provider": "anthropic", "prompt_version": "direct_v1", "pipeline": null, "generation_flow": "fun-redesign-72", "generation_temperature": null, "critique_model": null, "critique_score": null, "reasoning_pattern": "unexpected_journey", "fact_ids": [], "extra": {"stage": "initial_generation", "escape_hatch": true, "gen_craft_guards": true, "why_interesting": "A beloved Czech cartoon mole as a space traveller is pure delight. The duration and altitude clues make it solvable.", "topicality": {"tier": "none", "event_date": null, "rationale": "2011 space trip; historical trivia."}, "factcheck_tier": "web", "verified": true, "verification_score": 0.9, "verification_notes": "Plush Krtek flew on Space Shuttle Endeavour STS-134 (launched 16 May, landed 1 June 2011, about 16 days) with Andrew Feustel, so 'into space' is correct; see https://iol.co.za/news/2011-03-23-space-the-final-frontier-for-little-mole/"}, "created_at": null}, "cost_cents": null, "media_url": null, "image_subtype": null, "media_duration_seconds": null, "explanation": "Vzal ho s sebou astronaut Andrew Feustel na raketoplánu Endeavour až na Mezinárodní vesmírnou stanici.", "embedding_model": "text-embedding-3-small", "embedding_dim": 1536, "subtopic": null, "answer_key": null, "embedding_qa_model": "text-embedding-3-small", "expires_at": null, "freshness_tag": null, "boost_until": null}, {"id": "5ff1e733-6fe6-4b0f-bd4b-5936f786d49e", "question": "Česká hra Kingdom Come: Deliverance II z roku 2025 posílá hráče do Čech roku 1403. Které středověké město, proslulé stříbrnými doly, v ní mohou procházet?", "type": "text", "possible_answers": null, "correct_answer": "Kutná Hora", "alternative_answers": ["Kutnou Horu"], "headline_answer": null, "topic": "Videohry", "category": "entertainment", "difficulty": "easy", "tags": [], "language_dependent": false, "age_appropriate": "all", "language": "cs", "pack_id": null, "prompt_seed": "85f27c1ebe11fb90", "created_at": "2026-10-14T13:39:53.791761", "created_by": null, "source": "generated", "source_url": "https://store.epicgames.com/news/hands-on-with-kingdom-come-deliverance-2-s-gritty-medieval-world-and-holy-roman-empire-politics", "source_excerpt": "the details sell the illusion of Kuttenberg in 1403", "usage_count": 0, "user_ratings": {}, "review_status": "approved", "reviewed_by": "machine:gates-v1", "reviewed_at": "2026-10-14T11:43:16.036869Z", "review_notes": null, "quality_ratings": null, "generation_metadata": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "provider": "anthropic", "prompt_version": "direct_v1", "pipeline": null, "generation_flow": "fun-redesign-72", "generation_temperature": null, "critique_model": null, "critique_score": null, "reasoning_pattern": "real_place_in_fiction", "fact_ids": [], "extra": {"stage": "initial_generation", "escape_hatch": true, "gen_craft_guards": true, "why_interesting": "A Czech game that conquered the world lets players walk through a real Czech town. The silver-mining clue points every Czech straight to it.", "topicality": {"tier": "none", "event_date": null, "rationale": "2025 game setting; history/geography trivia, not fresh news."}, "factcheck_tier": "web", "verified": true, "verification_score": 0.9, "verification_notes": "KCD2 is set in 1403 Bohemia and features Kuttenberg (Kutná Hora), the historic silver-mining city, per https://store.epicgames.com/news/hands-on-with-kingdom-come-deliverance-2-s-gritty-medieval-world-and-holy-roman-empire-politics"}, "created_at": null}, "cost_cents": null, "media_url": null, "image_subtype": null, "media_duration_seconds": null, "explanation": "Kutná Hora byla tehdy jedním z nejbohatších měst Evropy. Ve hře je to největší a nejrušnější lokace.", "embedding_model": "text-embedding-3-small", "embedding_dim": 1536, "subtopic": null, "answer_key": null, "embedding_qa_model": "text-embedding-3-small", "expires_at": null, "freshness_tag": null, "boost_until": null}, {"id": "f2e80414-5ba8-4deb-bd26-d90e5bcb14ca", "question": "Která slavná skladba z roku 1975, šestiminutová směs balady, opery a hard rocku, má v názvu slovo odvozené od Čech?", "type": "text", "possible_answers": null, "correct_answer": "Bohemian Rhapsody", "alternative_answers": ["Bohemian Rhapsody od Queen"], "headline_answer": null, "topic": "Světová hudba", "category": "entertainment", "difficulty": "easy", "tags": [], "language_dependent": false, "age_appropriate": "all", "language": "cs", "pack_id": null, "prompt_seed": "85f27c1ebe11fb90", "created_at": "2026-10-14T13:39:53.791779", "created_by": null, "source": "generated", "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bohemian_Rhapsody", "source_excerpt": "It came out on 31 October 1975 as the lead single from A Night at the Opera.", "usage_count": 0, "user_ratings": {}, "review_status": "approved", "reviewed_by": "machine:gates-v1", "reviewed_at": "2026-10-14T11:43:16.036869Z", "review_notes": null, "quality_ratings": null, "generation_metadata": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "provider": "anthropic", "prompt_version": "direct_v1", "pipeline": null, "generation_flow": "fun-redesign-72", "generation_temperature": null, "critique_model": null, "critique_score": null, "reasoning_pattern": "hidden_connection", "fact_ids": [], "extra": {"stage": "initial_generation", "escape_hatch": true, "gen_craft_guards": true, "why_interesting": "Czechs hear 'Bohemia' in one of the world's most famous songs without ever thinking about it. The etymology payoff is the surprise.", "topicality": {"tier": "none", "event_date": null, "rationale": "Classic music trivia."}, "factcheck_tier": "web", "verified": true, "verification_score": 0.9, "verification_notes": "Bohemian Rhapsody (Queen, released 31 Oct 1975, 5:55) has ballad, opera and hard rock sections, and 'Bohemian' derives from Bohemia; no contradicting source found (https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bohemian_Rhapsody)."}, "created_at": null}, "cost_cents": null, "media_url": null, "image_subtype": null, "media_duration_seconds": null, "explanation": "S Čechami nemá nic společného, protože „bohémský“ znamená svobodný umělecký život. Francouzi kdysi mylně považovali kočovné Romy za příchozí z Čech a odtud to slovo pochází.", "embedding_model": "text-embedding-3-small", "embedding_dim": 1536, "subtopic": null, "answer_key": null, "embedding_qa_model": "text-embedding-3-small", "expires_at": null, "freshness_tag": null, "boost_until": null}, {"id": "6e57bf2f-e574-439e-8dea-d8cd6e6b2ef5", "question": "Jak se chudý malíř Jack Dawson v Titanicu dostal k lístku na slavnou loď?", "type": "text", "possible_answers": null, "correct_answer": "Vyhrál ho v pokeru", "alternative_answers": ["V kartách", "V pokeru", "Vyhrál ho v kartách"], "headline_answer": null, "topic": "Světový film", "category": "entertainment", "difficulty": "easy", "tags": [], "language_dependent": false, "age_appropriate": "all", "language": "cs", "pack_id": null, "prompt_seed": "85f27c1ebe11fb90", "created_at": "2026-10-14T13:39:53.791800", "created_by": null, "source": "generated", "source_url": "https://m.imdb.com/title/tt0120338/plotsummary", "source_excerpt": "Jack Dawson is a drifter and artist who wins a ticket in a card game.", "usage_count": 0, "user_ratings": {}, "review_status": "approved", "reviewed_by": "machine:gates-v1", "reviewed_at": "2026-10-14T11:43:16.036869Z", "review_notes": null, "quality_ratings": null, "generation_metadata": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "provider": "anthropic", "prompt_version": "direct_v1", "pipeline": null, "generation_flow": "fun-redesign-72", "generation_temperature": null, "critique_model": null, "critique_score": null, "reasoning_pattern": "plot_detail", "fact_ids": [], "extra": {"stage": "initial_generation", "escape_hatch": true, "gen_craft_guards": true, "why_interesting": "Everyone saw Titanic, but the lucky gamble that starts the whole tragedy is the kind of detail people half-remember.", "topicality": {"tier": "none", "event_date": null, "rationale": "Classic film trivia."}, "factcheck_tier": "web", "verified": true, "verification_score": 0.9, "verification_notes": "Jack wins the Titanic ticket in a poker game, per the IMDb plot summary https://m.imdb.com/title/tt0120338/plotsummary; no newer event affects this."}, "created_at": null}, "cost_cents": null, "media_url": null, "image_subtype": null, "media_duration_seconds": null, "explanation": "Jack vyhraje lístek v kartách pár minut před vyplutím a na palubu doslova doběhne. Ta šťastná výhra ho nakonec stojí život.", "embedding_model": "text-embedding-3-small", "embedding_dim": 1536, "subtopic": null, "answer_key": null, "embedding_qa_model": "text-embedding-3-small", "expires_at": null, "freshness_tag": null, "boost_until": null}, {"id": "25272f3b-5ee0-4c71-924